  referenceCheckTranscript: '<b>Harold Dunwell:</b> Dunwell Paper! Speak up, I''m
    ninety-two.


    <b>You:</b> I''m calling about Brenda Fishwick.


    <b>Harold
    Dunwell:</b> Brenda! {rc_best}. Never missed a deadline. {rc_complaint}. Please
    don''t take her, I''ll have to learn the printer again.'
